for i,n,a,b,c in conditions:text.append(f'| {i}: {n} | {a} | {b} |')
text+=['','These are optional analyst checks, not five extra participant questions or a scoring model. Four original hypotheses, three propositions, five contract segments plus the employer-use hypothesis, fourteen report questions and six buyer/six member IDs remain unchanged.','', '## Specific competitors and earlier prompt evidence','', 'All six earlier recruitment comparators and JGA remain in the context map. Resources, expert interviews, payroll events, personalised interpretation and post-search advice are different alternatives. A company may be a source, distributor, buyer or funder for a particular exchange; none is prequalified by this desk review. [Competitor/task check](research-notes/t02-second-check/competitors/COMPETITOR-AND-TASK-CHECK.md).','', 'The new narrow bridge uses exact S03-C, S08-C and S09-C prompts: US domestic payroll leadership, UK-based EMEA remit and a Manchester role governing a UK/European provider transition. Twenty-four saved answers have 126 lineage checks; three ChatGPT-r1 texts were semantically reread. The other 21 received integrity checks, not fresh fact validation. Office presence, product labels, model rankings and generated weights do not establish actual evidence coverage or buyer demand. No models were rerun. [Bridge](research-notes/t02-second-check/competitors/PRIOR-STUDY-BRIDGE.md).','', '## Apply the findings','', 'Use the [offer-fit and wording supplement](T02-OFFER-FIT-AND-WORDING.md) before any future authorised concept exposure. Keep the promised full practitioner research, JGA commissioned-IP rights and current defect remedies. If the edition supports only a narrower exploratory use, say so; this does not reduce the complete contracted publication or remove otherwise eligible usable research contributions.','', 'The supporting historical, market and exact-concept memos, two new primary routes and canonical reuses are linked through the [structured second-check map](T02-second-challenge-map.json). New records are bounded source/context and analyst applications, not additional respondents, demand estimates or prices.','', 'T03 actual input and existing collection decisions remain open. No new work is committed, no financial input or price is populated, and no licence, event, participant or sponsor is confirmed. After this review, T04/T05 can use the more precise product/work units when building commercial routes, cost and cash assumptions. Nothing was sent, purchased, booked or collected.']
